      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فسّأهُ</span></b> , namely, a garment, or piece of cloth, (S,
M, O, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْسِئَةٌ</span> (S, O) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْسِىْءٌ</span>, (S,)
<i>He stretched it so that it rent,</i> or <i>became ragged,</i>
or <i>dissundered:</i> (S, O:) or <i>he rent it;</i> as also
